This is the controller mapping for the robot

Gamepad 1(driver and intake):
    l bumper hold: intake in
    r bumper hold: intake out
    L joystick y axis: moves the robot forward/backward
    L joystick x axis: turns the robot left/right
    R joystick x axis: strafes left/right

Gamepad 2(transfer and shooter):
    l bumper hold: launcher
    r bumper hold: transfer
    r trigger hold: transfer reverse
    x button (bottom): switch outtake manual power


Deprecated:
    button A: stops intake
    l shoulder: intake on
    r shoulder: intake reverse
    button B: toggles outtake

    L trigger: transfer on
    R trigger: transfer reverse
    button X: transfer off